      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just spilled boiling pasta water on my arm while making dinner. its really red and some nasty looking blisters are already starting to pop up. it hurts so bad. should i put some butter or maybe some thick vaseline on it to cool it down and keep the air off it?",
