    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm worried a doctor is gonna tell me i have to go to the ER and that's just gonna be way too expensive right now. it doesn't look *that* bad once the initial sting goes away. if i just use a thick layer of ointment or some coconut oil, wouldnt that seal it up and help it heal faster? it feels like it needs a barrier.",
